sequenceDiagram
    participant R as Requester
    participant RS as Report Service (pending)
    participant O as Order Service
    participant C as Courier
    participant A as Admin
    R->>RS: Report own DELIVERED item, one category + evidence
    RS->>O: Place report-specific hold (requester token)
    O-->>RS: Hold committed
    RS-->>C: Await response, deadline +8h
    alt Courier responds before deadline
      C->>RS: Explanation + evidence
    else Deadline passes
      RS->>RS: Server marks ready without response
    end
    RS->>RS: READY_FOR_REVIEW
    A->>RS: Review accounts and Order
    opt Separate Order decision
      A->>O: Cancel / complete / waive overdue with reason
    end
    A->>RS: Mark RESOLVED with outcome
    RS->>RS: Save resolution + durable release intent
    RS->>O: Release this report hold (admin token)
    O->>O: Lock, audit release, EXISTS remaining active holds
    O-->>RS: OrderResponse
    Note over RS: Local sample prototype only; real provider and durable orchestration pending
